 百萬電子伏(MeV)─20 百萬電子伏(MeV)\n>20 百萬電子伏(MeV)\n質子(回跳質子除外)能量>2 百萬電子伏(MeV)\nα 粒子，分裂碎片，重核","sup":[[21,24],[27,30]]},{"c":1,"rs":1,"cs":1,"text":"1\n1\n5\n10\n20\n10\n5\n5\n20"}]],"head":1},{"t":"p","text":"(1)表中數值均與入射至人體或發自體內之輻射有關。","center":false},{"t":"p","text":"(2)表中未述及之輻射種類或能量範圍，其加權因數可依公式（1.1）及（1.2）求得。","center":false},{"t":"p","text":"(3)束縛於去氧核醣核酸(DNA)之原子發射之奧杰電子(Auger electrons)除外。","center":false},{"t":"p","text":"(4)中子之輻射加權因數詳如圖一所示。","center":false},{"t":"diagram","w":272.7,"h":205.05,"runs":[{"text":"輻","x":26.17,"y":14.49,"size":9.96},{"text":"-","x":191.85,"y":21.41,"size":12.0},{"text":"-","x":203.85,"y":21.41,"size":12.0},{"text":"漸","x":221.85,"y":21.41,"size":12.0},{"text":"近","x":233.85,"y":21.41,"size":12.0},{"text":"曲","x":245.85,"y":21.41,"size":12.0},{"text":"線","x":257.85,"y":21.41,"size":12.0},{"text":"2","x":46.87,"y":19.49,"size":8.04},{"text":"5","x":50.95,"y":19.49,"size":8.04},{"text":"射","x":26.17,"y":24.45,"size":9.96},{"text":"加","x":26.17,"y":34.41,"size":9.96},{"text":"權","x":26.17,"y":44.37,"size":9.96},{"text":"2","x":46.39,"y":48.41,"size":8.04},{"text":"0","x":50.47,"y":48.41,"size":8.04},{"text":"因","x":26.17,"y":54.45,"size":9.96},{"text":"數","x":26.17,"y":64.41,"size":9.96},{"text":"1","x":46.39,"y":76.61,"size":8.04},{"text":"5","x":50.47,"y":76.61,"size":8.04},{"text":"1","x":46.39,"y":104.81,"size":8.04},{"text":"0","x":50.47,"y":104.81,"size":8.04},{"text":"5","x":51.19,"y":133.49,"size":8.04},{"text":"-","x":59.23,"y":158.21,"size":5.04},{"text":"6","x":60.79,"y":158.21,"size":5.04},{"text":"-","x":83.23,"y":158.21,"size":5.04},{"text":"5","x":84.79,"y":158.21,"size":5.04},{"text":"-","x":104.23,"y":158.21,"size":5.04},{"text":"4","x":105.79,"y":158.21,"size":5.04},{"text":"-","x":126.07,"y":158.21,"size":5.04},{"text":"3","x":127.63,"y":158.21,"size":5.04},{"text":"-","x":147.09,"y":158.21,"size":5.04},{"text":"2","x":148.65,"y":158.21,"size":5.04},{"text":"-","x":168.09,"y":158.21,"size":5.04},{"text":"1","x":169.65,"y":158.21,